      "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a Noetherian ring.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a prime number and <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a finite <MATH_0005>-group.\nLet <MATH_0006> be a finite <MATH_0007>-module annihilated by <MATH_0008>.\nThen there is a finite filtration\n<MATH_0009>\nby <MATH_0010>-submodules\nsuch that <MATH_0011> acts trivially on <MATH_0012> for all\n<MATH_0013>.\n",
